      "degree_level": "Bachelor, Master",
      "process_description": "Master’s theses (and BSc theses) at IFI are handled via the department’s fact sheets and registration forms. Eligible students are those enrolled in the relevant BSc/MSc programmes. To find a supervisor use the “Specializations and Topics per Professor” table, the Master Project Market (MPM) or research-group pages and contact professors/groups directly. Register by completing the “Registration form Master’s thesis” (PDF) and submit all registrations and the final thesis electronically from your UZH e‑mail address to studies@ifi.uzh.ch. Follow the Master’s Thesis and “Preparation of BSc/MSc Theses” fact sheets (including the plagiarism fact sheet), respect the required order Master’s Project > Master’s Thesis, and consult the faculty’s framework ordinances/study regulations and the UZH Integrity Ordinance for formal rules and deadlines.",
